From de13a2473ca10420bf4cafa5e8f42902c546806b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:23:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(session): abort and continue every operation; stop check

Repo::abort/continue_operation run git's own commands without a
deadline, in the user's locale, with GIT_EDITOR=:. refresh_stop
reports a moved-on stop before settling anything. A pick or revert
inside a rebase is its own stop.

Refs plan #85 #88 #89
